**What to check in your own answer.** The two tests in `register-helper.spec.ts` still call the helper with an email only, and they still pass, because the default value fills the Phone field when a call leaves the phone out. The alternative, a second function named for the phone, would hold a second copy of the ten lines, and the two copies would drift apart at the first change to the form. Your times may be different.
